Neither printed; the first transmitted a financial appendix to NSC 160 (regarding this appendix, see footnote 1, infra);
                    while the second transmitted the views of the Joint Chiefs of Staff on NSC 160. These views are presented in the
                    memorandum of discussion printed here. (S/S–NSC files, lot 63 D 351, NSC 160 Series)
